   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RS! Uganda- Tea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to a responsible and inclusive global tea value chain that ensures value is distributed fairly, smallholder tea farmers and workers benefit from decent working conditions, and tea is produced with respect to the environment.Target audience - smallscale tea growers, multistakeholder platforms, marginalised or socially excluded groups, vulnerable groups e.g. children in vulnerable working conditions Objectives</narrative>
  </description>
